{"Title":"An Act to extend the time for the issuance of alcoholic beverage licenses in the town of Burlington","BillNumber":"H4909","DocketNumber":"HD5462","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2024-10-30T09:45:06.023"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2024-10-30T09:45:06.0233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4909/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Gordon of Bedford, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4909) of Kenneth I. Gordon (by vote of the town) for legislation to extend the time for the issuance of alcoholic beverage licenses in the town of Burlington.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection (e) of section 1 of chapter 9 of the acts of 2020 is hereby amended by striking out the words “not later than 5 years after the effective date of this act” and inserting in place thereof the following words: “on or before January 22, 2028”.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall be effective upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}